 \n\nOf the given options, the only one that is not a closed curve is the following:\n\n![](images/22/22a50051d5281880b40c0960c2de28ce077e836a4bf1c84193d13154ff25f6a5.png)"} :step/id #uuid "9c643061-7cf9-5282-9130-02e247ef91c3" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418069}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418071 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418065 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f1d85587-6895-544b-83c3-34df9dd81893" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473602} {:answer/id #uuid "f00c4a71-2d1b-5f53-81d8-6257ba61cfd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473603}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473602} :answer-field/id #uuid "cbf923bc-0b2a-5219-b161-b37d4db63dcb" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474196} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ac6713d6-7624-50c7-b7b3-3b5824aa724f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473604} {:answer/id #uuid "87254a41-7712-5e74-a7d2-a329560b2b80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473605}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473604} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f4ebb3f-b63b-57e1-bfec-ab0e13d499de" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474197} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c729ca4-97e3-5817-b02e-7cfbcd5b7195" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473606} {:answer/id #uuid "9ebdad6a-41c8-59ad-af2d-d72af1deabc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473607}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473607} :answer-field/id #uuid "ca8bfa6b-b929-5e74-80aa-3b5b316eeba5" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474198} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f89864d9-d767-5f8d-ba22-642be7cf1213" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473608} {:answer/id #uuid "123eea51-48b5-53a9-b7ce-0110b86f53ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473609}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473609} :answer-field/id #uuid "43158257-ec4b-5929-bea8-451716d8f491" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474199}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "d6641b4f-e396-5ff5-8410-bd9f53c4e8d6" :question/math-academy-id "q-98339" :question/problem "![](images/98/9836234d763ccb3da6b9ac0360dcb3662cacc5fc90d5ecc2dee20bf29ce0c77d.png)\n\nWhich of the curves above is simple, closed, and negatively oriented?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A simple closed curve is positively oriented if, when traveling along it, one always has the curve interior to the left and the curve exterior to the right. Otherwise, the curve is negatively oriented. \n\nA curve is positively oriented if it is traversed counterclockwise and is negatively oriented if it is traversed clockwise.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the curves:\n\n- Curve I is neither simple nor closed.\n\n- Curve II is a simple and closed curve but it is not negatively oriented. The arrows indicate that the curve is traversed counterclockwise, so it is positively oriented.\n\n- Curve III is simple, closed, negatively oriented. The arrows indicate that the curve is traversed clockwise.\n\n- Curve IV is simple, closed, negatively oriented. The arrows indicate that the curve is traversed clockwise.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III and IV only.\""} :step/id #uuid "bba698a5-c622-5631-9486-7b254dcdc5b9"}] :activity/title "Simple, Closed, and Oriented Curves" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186418052}]}
